sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ODH as opendatahub-operator
    participant User as User / Workbench<br/>Kubeflow SDK
    participant API as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Module as spark-operator-module-controller
    participant WH as spark-operator-webhook<br/>Svc 443 to 9443/TCP TLS
    participant Ctrl as spark-operator-controller<br/>spark-submit in-process
    participant Driver as Spark driver pod
    participant Exec as Spark executor pods
    participant Conn as SparkConnect server<br/>15002/TCP gRPC
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>PodMonitor

    rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
    Note over ODH,Module: Flow 1 - Platform enablement
    ODH->>API: Create SparkOperator/default-sparkoperator, deploy module<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+, SA token
    API-->>Module: Watch SparkOperator CR<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+, SA token
    Module->>API: Server-side apply CRDs, RBAC, Deployments,<br/>webhook configs, NetworkPolicies, PodMonitors
    Module->>API: Update SparkOperator.status conditions + releases
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
    Note over User,Exec: Flow 2 - SparkApplication submission
    User->>API: Create SparkApplication<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+, user bearer token
    API->>WH: Mutate + validate SparkApplication<br/>HTTPS, cluster TLS profile, caBundle-pinned<br/>job namespaces only, failurePolicy Fail
    WH-->>API: AdmissionReview response
    API-->>Ctrl: Watch event
    Ctrl->>API: spark-submit creates driver pod, ConfigMaps, Services<br/>HTTPS TLS via JVM, controller SA token
    API->>WH: /mutate--v1-pod for driver pod<br/>HTTPS, caBundle
    Driver->>API: Create executor pods<br/>HTTPS TLS, driver SA
    API->>WH: /mutate--v1-pod for executor pods
    Exec->>Driver: Spark RPC 7078/7079/TCP<br/>no encryption by default, no auth
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 230)
    Note over User,Conn: Flow 3 - Interactive SparkConnect session
    User->>API: Create SparkConnect<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+, user token
    API-->>Ctrl: Watch event
    Ctrl->>API: Create server pod + Service<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+, controller SA
    User->>Conn: gRPC 15002/TCP<br/>no TLS, no app auth<br/>NetworkPolicy: same ns + workbench pods
    Conn-->>User: Spark results
    end

    rect rgb(245, 240, 255)
    Note over Prom,Ctrl: Flow 4 - Metrics scraping
    Prom->>Ctrl: GET /metrics 8080/TCP HTTPS<br/>service-CA cert, no authn
    Prom->>WH: GET /metrics 8080/TCP HTTPS<br/>service-CA cert, no authn
    end
